@startuml Create_User_Manually
title Activity Diagram - Create User Manually

|Admin|
start
:Open User Management;
:Click "Create New User";
:Enter user details:\n- Full Name\n- Email\n- Phone (optional)\n- Role\n- Password;
:Click "Create";

|Web Application|
:Validate input data;
if (Valid?) then (no)
  :Display validation error;
  stop
endif

:Send user creation data\nto backend;

|Backend API|
:Validate request body;
:Call UserService.\nCreateUserAsync(request);
:Check if email already exists;
if (Email exists?) then (yes)
  :Return 409 Conflict\n"Email already exists";
  stop
endif

:Hash password using BCrypt;
:Create new User entity:\n- FullName\n- Email\n- Phone\n- RoleId\n- PasswordHash\n- CreatedAt\n- UpdatedAt;
:Save to database;
:Get user with role information;
:Return UserResponseDto;
:Send 201 Created response;

|Web Application|
if (Response successful?) then (yes)
  :Display success message;
  :Refresh user list;
else (no)
  :Display error message;
  stop
endif

|Admin|
:View new user in list;
stop
@enduml



